      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This anacondaur-like creature has two long extended claws meant to rend his foes and a third eye for petrifying unsuspecting foes.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 22, touch 12, flat-footed 19 (+3 dex, +10 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 66 [98] (7d10+28)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +8, Will +5</p><p>Immune Deafness, Petrification/Statue</p><p>Weakness Water</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft., Climb 20 ft., Swim 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +11 (2d6+5), 2 Claws +11 (1d8+5)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Petrify, Rend (2 claws, 1d8+7)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 20, Dex 16, Con 18, Int 3, Wis 16, Cha 7</p><p>Base Atk +7; CMB +13; CMD 26 (30 vs trip)</p><p>Feats Feral Combat Training, Improved Unarmed Strike, Scorpion Style, Weapon Focus (Claw)</p><p>Skills Climb +12, Perception +11, Stealth +9, Swim +13; Racial Modifiers +2 Perception, +4 Stealth</p>"
